software or web application, including data breaches, service disruptions, or unauthorized access resulting from the application.<br/>\n•	The service owner must test their software for risks/vulnerabilities before deployment and a report will be submitted to MIS.<br/>\n•	Required patch update or anything needful to ensure cyber security must be done by developer or organization.<br/>\n•	In the case of API integration, the service owner must comply with all terms and conditions as outlined in the API contract.<br/>\n•	DGHS will perform centralized backup (minimum 24 hour interval) of data from the above specified location only and the data will be retained as per retention policy.<br/>\n•	For DB backup, Database Administrator is fully responsible for storing the dump files into the defined backup directory as per above specified RPO time interval.<br/>\n•	RPO (Recovery Point Objective) is the maximum time of data loss that can tolerate.<br/>\n•	Basic installation of OS will be done by DGHS. In case of any specific package installation/configuration will be required, then DGHS will provide console login to the server so that application vendor can install OS/packages of their own.<br/>\n•	Each deployed system must undergo an half yearly review and renewal process. The service owner must submit a renewal request. Failure to renew within the stipulated period may result in suspension or decommissioning of the system.<br/>\n•	If the system is no longer in use for any reason, then the system owner will inform to MIS, DGHS.<br/>\nBy signing below, the service owner agrees to the above terms and confirms compliance with the stated conditions.<br/>\n            ','DGHS, Mohakhali, Dhaka','','','Dr. MD ZAHIDUL ISLAM','MIS','OSD','01715121973','sofordar@mis.dghs.gov.bd','Dr. MD ZAHIDUL ISLAM','OSD','01715121973','sofordar@mis.dghs.gov.bd','Dr. MD ZAHIDUL ISLAM','OSD','01715121973','sofordar@mis.dghs.gov.bd','Crystal Technology Bangladesh','Green Road','01849457282','mostafakhu